  <h2>Read and choose</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Directions for a visitor</h3>
    <p><span class="ex">“Hi Omar! Here are the directions to my apartment. From the station, go straight for two blocks and turn left at the traffic light. Go past the bank and take the first street on the right. My building is on the corner, across from the park. See you at 6:00!”</span></p>
  </div>
